{"speciesId":565,"names":{"fr":"Mégapagos","es":"Carracosta","en":"Carracosta","ja":"アバゴーラ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il vit sur terre et en mer. Ses bras surpuissants peuvent percer des trous dans la coque des paquebots."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"They can live both in the ocean and on land. A slap from one of them is enough to open a hole in the bottom of a tanker."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Ses mâchoires sont très puissantes. Il dévore sans distinction ses proies, l’acier et les rochers."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Incredible jaw strength enables them to chew up steel beams and rocks along with their prey."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It could knock out a foe with a slap from one of its developed front appendages and chew it up, shell or bones and all."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It could knock out a foe with a slap from one of its developed front appendages and chew it up, shell or bones and all."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il vit sur terre et en mer. Ses bras surpuissants peuvent percer des trous dans la coque des paquebots."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Vive en el mar y en la superficie. Sus garras pueden abrir un agujero en el fondo de un petrolero."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"They can live both in the ocean and on land. A slap from one of them is enough to open a hole in the bottom of a tanker."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"海と 陸地で 生活する。 張り手で タンカーの 船底に 穴を 開ける パワーの 持ち主。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Ses bras puissants serrent ses proies jusqu’à l’évanouissement. Il les dévore ensuite, carapace et os compris."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Un golpe con sus desarrolladas aletas delanteras puede hacer perder a un rival el conocimiento o romperle los huesos."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It could knock out a foe with a slap from one of its developed front appendages and chew it up, shell or bones and all."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"発達した 前足で 相手を ひっぱたき 気絶させると 殻や ホネまで まるごと かみくだいた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il vit sur terre et en mer. Ses bras surpuissants peuvent percer des trous dans la coque des paquebots."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Vive en el mar y en la superficie. Sus garras pueden abrir un agujero en el fondo de un petrolero."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"They can live both in the ocean and on land. A slap from one of them is enough to open a hole in the bottom of a tanker."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"海と 陸地で 生活する。 張り手で タンカーの 船底に 穴を 開ける パワーの 持ち主。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Ses bras puissants serrent ses proies jusqu’à l’évanouissement. Il les dévore ensuite, carapace et os compris."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Un golpe con sus desarrolladas aletas delanteras puede hacer perder a un rival el conocimiento o romperle los huesos."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"It could knock out a foe with a slap from one of its developed front appendages and chew it up, shell or bones and all."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"発達した 前足で 相手を ひっぱたき 気絶させると 殻や ホネまで まるごと かみくだいた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Pour se constituer une carapace solide, il devait réduire en miettes les os et coquilles riches en minéraux de ses proies avant de les avaler."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Trituraba los huesos y las duras conchas de sus presas para aprovechar bien los nutrientes y reforzar así su propio caparazón."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It constructed its sturdy shell by crunching and swallowing the hard shells or bones of its prey."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"丈夫な 甲羅を つくるため 獲物の 硬い殻や 骨も 丸ごと 噛み砕いて 喰っていた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Aussi à l’aise sur terre que dans l’eau, ce Pokémon chasse ses proies à la surface puis les entraîne sous la mer pour les noyer."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Vive tanto en el mar como en la superficie. En tierra firme, caza a sus presas y las arrastra hacia el mar, donde les da el golpe de gracia."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Active both on land and in the sea, this Pokémon drags its land-based prey into the water to finish it off."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"海と 陸地の 両方で 活動する。 陸の 獲物は 海に 引きずり込んで 仕留める。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"L’incroyable puissance de sa mâchoire lui permettait de broyer facilement les coquilles d’Amonistar ou d’Amonita pour les manger."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"La brutal presión que ejerce con su mandíbula es tal que las conchas de Omastar y Omanyte no son ninguna molestia cuando los devora."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Its jaws are terrifyingly powerful. It could eat Omastar and Omanyte whole and not be bothered in the slightest by their shells."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"アゴの 力が 凄まじい。 オムスターや オムナイトの カラも 気にせず 丸ごと 食っていた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Afin de renforcer sa carapace, ce Pokémon va même jusqu’à manger la coquille et les os de ses proies."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Para reforzar aún más su robusto caparazón, engulle incluso las conchas y los huesos de las presas que captura."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Carracosta eats every last bit of the prey it catches, even the shells and bones, to further strengthen its sturdy shell."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"硬い 甲羅を 更に 丈夫に するために 捕らえた 獲物は カラやホネまで 残さず 食うのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il dévore les os et la coquille de ses proies, ce qui épaissit et renforce sa propre carapace."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Devora incluso los huesos y caparazones de sus presas, por lo que el suyo propio se vuelve duro y grueso."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Carracosta completely devours its prey—bones, shells, and all. Because of this, Carracosta’s own shell grows thick and sturdy."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"獲物の 殻や骨も 残さず きれいに たいらげるので 甲羅は ぶ厚く 硬く 成長する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Bien qu’il soit moins à l’aise sur terre que dans l’eau, il s’aventure sur le rivage pour se nourrir."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Aunque se mueva con mayor lentitud sobre la superficie terrestre que en el agua, emerge a tierra en busca de presas."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"This Pokémon emerges from the water in search of prey despite the fact that it moves more slowly on land."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"水の中と くらべて 動きは 鈍いが 獲物を 探し求め 陸上でも 活動するぞ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":565,"moves":[{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"bite","learns":[[11,"level-up",8],[14,"level-up",8],[15,"level-up",8],[16,"level-up",8],[17,"level-up",8],[18,"level-up",8],[20,"level-up",15]]},{"name":"water-gun","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"hydro-pump","learns":[[11,"level-up",61],[14,"level-up",61],[15,"level-up",61],[16,"level-up",61],[17,"level-up",61],[18,"level-up",61],[20,"level-up",46],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"surf","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-beam","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"blizzard","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"low-kic